lices, rather than continuing as a tubular structure.\"\n\nFinally, the response format is crucial: \"Nodule or Vessel. [Reasoning sentence]. [Diameter] mm.\" I'll refine it: Nodule. The structure is a discrete, roughly spherical opacity that appears and disappears over the sequence of slices rather than continuing as a tubular structure. 3 mm. Yes, that looks good.\n\n\n",
